The package redistributes Protocol Buffer definitions it does not own. They
live under `proto/` and are the input to the generated code in
`Sources/_GRPCProtobufGenerated/`. This file records where each group of
files came from, the license it was published under, and how the copies in
this repository differ from upstream.

## proto/kurrentdb/v1/ — KurrentDB v1 gRPC API

Files: `cluster.proto`, `gossip.proto`, `monitoring.proto`,
`operations.proto`, `persistent.proto`, `projections.proto`,
`redaction.proto`, `serverfeatures.proto`, `shared.proto`, `streams.proto`,
`users.proto`.

Source: https://github.com/EventStore/EventStore, directory
`src/Protos/Grpc/`, tag `oss-v23.10.0`.

License: the EventStoreDB License as published at that tag, which is the
3-clause BSD license. Copyright (c) 2011-2023, Event Store Ltd. All rights
reserved. The license text is reproduced at the end of this file.

Local changes: `import` paths are prefixed with `kurrentdb/v1/` and the
`java_package` option differs. Messages and services are unchanged.

The same service definitions are also published by Kurrent, Inc. under the
Apache License 2.0 in the official client repositories, for example
https://github.com/kurrent-io/KurrentDB-Client-Dotnet and
https://github.com/kurrent-io/KurrentDB-Client-Go, and under the MIT License
in https://github.com/kurrent-io/KurrentDB-Client-Rust.

## proto/kurrent/rpc/ and proto/kurrentdb/v2/streams/ — KurrentDB v2 gRPC API

Files: `kurrent/rpc/errors.proto`, `kurrent/rpc/rpc.proto`,
`kurrentdb/v2/streams/errors.proto`, `kurrentdb/v2/streams/streams.proto`.

Source: https://github.com/kurrent-io/KurrentDB-Client-Dotnet, directory
`src/KurrentDB.Client/Core/proto/`, as of commit `0407e281` (2026-05-19).

License: Apache License 2.0. Copyright 2011-2025 Kurrent, Inc. The license
text is in `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

Local changes: the files are copied verbatim except that in
`kurrent/rpc/rpc.proto` the `ErrorMetadata error` extension of
`google.protobuf.EnumValueOptions` uses field number 50000 instead of 2113.

## proto/google/rpc/code.proto and proto/kurrentdb/v1/status.proto

These are Google API common protos. Each file carries its own Apache License
2.0 header, Copyright Google LLC; the license text is in
`LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

`google/rpc/code.proto`: from https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis,
`google/rpc/code.proto`. It matches the current upstream file except for the
year in the copyright header (2022 here).

`kurrentdb/v1/status.proto`: from https://github.com/EventStore/EventStore,
`src/Protos/Grpc/status.proto`, tag `oss-v23.10.0` — the same source as the
v1 API above. That file is Event Store's modified copy of Google's
`google/rpc/status.proto`: `code` is a `google.rpc.Code` instead of an
`int32`, `details` is a single `google.protobuf.Any` instead of a repeated
field, and it imports `code.proto` and sets `cc_enable_arenas`. Our only
change to Event Store's copy is that it imports `google/rpc/code.proto` by
that path.

